       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    TINVINQ.
       AUTHOR.        K. MOVSESIAN.
       INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  SEPT. 27, 1984.

      *REMARKS.       INVOICE INQUIRY.
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *   T I N V I N Q                                    AP2     *
      *D   THIS PROGRAM IS THE INVOICE INQUIRY PROGRAM.            *
      *D   THE USER CAN INQUIRE BY :  1) REGISTER NO.              *
      *D                              2) REGISTER AND ITEM NO.     *
      *D                              3) INVOICE NUMBER            *
      *D                              4) PO NUMBER                 *
      *D                              5) VENDOR CODE               *
      *                                                            *
      **************************************************************


       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.    IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.    IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZINVINQ-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC         PIC X(2000).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01  COMMAND-AREA.
           05  OVERRIDE-ZINVINQ      PIC X(33)    VALUE
               "OVRDSPF FILE(ZINVINQ) SHARE(*YES)".
           05  OVERRIDE-PARM2        PIC S9(10)V9(5) COMP-3 VALUE 33.
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **      V I E W   C O M M U N I C A T I O N   A R E A      **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************

       COPY VCOMAREA   IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DBSTHIST  IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DATAB     IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **             D A T A B A S E   B U F F E R S             **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************


       COPY TBLOWUP   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY LANGUAGE  IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPDATA  IN COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       PROC-DIV SECTION 01.
       BEGIN-HERE.
           PERFORM 1-HSK THRU 1-HSK-X.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE.
           GOBACK.


       1-HSK.
           MOVE "TINVINQ"  TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "QCMDEXC" USING OVERRIDE-ZINVINQ, OVERRIDE-PARM2.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE.

       1-HSK-X.
           EXIT.



       2-BLOWUP.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
               VIEW-COMAREA, DISPLAY-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
                       BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

       2-BLOWUP-X.
           EXIT.



       MAIN-PROCESSING SECTION 02.
       6-MAIN.
           CALL "SINVINQS" USING BASE,
                                 BASE-STHIST,
                                 VIEW-COMAREA,
                                 LANGUAGE-PARMS.

       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

